{"__space":0.27783203125,"Introducing - The Time Based Ranges Academy.":[5.4990234375,0.3330078125,1.77783203125,2.31591796875,3.00146484375,3.6123046875,4.650390625],"The Time Based Ranges Academy is the 1on1 mentorship program I built to walk you through this entire process…":[1.77783203125,2.31591796875,3.00146484375,3.6123046875,4.44677734375,0.833984375,1.5,2.333984375,5.44482421875,4.05615234375,0.27783203125,2.1103515625,0.94384765625,2.16796875,1.77783203125,3.7763671875,1.77783203125,2.72314453125,4.83544921875],"And help you become a consistently profitable, funded trader.":[1.94384765625,2.0556640625,1.77783203125,3.779296875,0.55615234375,5.8349609375,4.83349609375,3.33251953125,3.05712890625],"I actually guarantee that, so there's zero risk on your end.":[0.27783203125,3.72412109375,4.779296875,2.11083984375,1.1669921875,3.2392578125,2.05615234375,1.779296875,1.2216796875,2.1669921875,2.0556640625],"We'll get to that in a second.":[2.275390625,1.5,0.94384765625,1.8330078125,0.888671875,0.55615234375,3.77880859375],"But before that, let me explain exactly how the whole thing works.":[1.666015625,3.05615234375,2.11083984375,1.1669921875,1.4453125,3.44580078125,3.3916015625,1.99951171875,1.5,2.83349609375,2.443359375,3.16796875],"And I want to be really clear about what this is and what it isn't.":[1.94384765625,0.27783203125,2.27783203125,0.94384765625,1.1669921875,2.61328125,2.33544921875,2.7216796875,2.27783203125,1.77783203125,0.833984375,1.77783203125,2.27783203125,0.61083984375,2.29345703125],"This is NOT a course.":[2.0556640625,0.833984375,2.11083984375,0.55615234375,3.55712890625],"This isn't some Discord where you get dropped in and left to watch videos on your own.":[2.0556640625,2.015625,2.6123046875,3.72314453125,2.89013671875,1.77783203125,1.5,3.99951171875,0.888671875,1.77783203125,1.5,0.94384765625,2.833984375,3.16796875,1.2216796875,2.1669921875,2.27734375],"This is hands-on mentorship.":[2.0556640625,0.833984375,4.49951171875,5.72265625],"Me personally taking you through all of it, and making sure you can execute the TBR consistently and profitably.":[1.38916015625,5.001953125,2.94482421875,1.77783203125,3.7763671875,1.11181640625,0.94384765625,0.888671875,1.77783203125,3.5009765625,2.1123046875,1.77783203125,1.72314453125,3.724609375,1.5,2.05517578125,5.8349609375,1.77783203125,4.75927734375],"So how does the TBR Academy actually work?":[1.27783203125,1.99951171875,2.333984375,1.5,2.05517578125,4.44677734375,3.72412109375,2.94482421875],"It's a 12-week intensive bootcamp…":[1.40478515625,0.55615234375,3.8916015625,4.3349609375,5.77783203125],"1)  1on1 Onboarding call, just you and me":[0.88916015625,2.333984375,5.666015625,1.94580078125,1.77783203125,1.77783203125,1.77783203125,1.4453125],"Before you touch anything, we get on a call together.":[3.16748046875,1.77783203125,2.7216796875,4.4443359375,1.333984375,1.5,1.2216796875,0.55615234375,1.66796875,4.22265625],"I want to see where you're actually at…":[0.27783203125,2.27783203125,0.94384765625,1.66845703125,2.89013671875,2.9609375,3.72412109375,1.88916015625],"What you're trading now, what account you're on, how much time you've got in the morning, and what's been going wrong.":[2.44384765625,2.9609375,3.388671875,2.240234375,2.27783203125,3.833984375,2.9609375,1.49951171875,1.99951171875,2.6669921875,2.05615234375,3.1279296875,1.5546875,0.888671875,1.5,4.27734375,1.77783203125,3.07177734375,2.333984375,2.72119140625,3.27734375],"From there I’ll identify and help you “unlearn” the stuff that’s been holding you back…":[2.5,2.4453125,1.111328125,3.5556640625,1.77783203125,2.0556640625,1.77783203125,4.61181640625,1.5,2.166015625,2.6298828125,2.333984375,3.60986328125,1.77783203125,3.279296875],"And map it out the plan for the next 12 weeks.":[1.94384765625,2.05615234375,0.61083984375,1.5546875,1.5,2.0556640625,1.3330078125,1.5,2.05615234375,1.1123046875,3.2802734375],"You come off that call knowing exactly what you're doing tomorrow morning.":[1.814453125,2.6123046875,1.27685546875,1.8330078125,1.66796875,4.05517578125,3.3916015625,2.27783203125,2.9609375,2.72119140625,4.61083984375,4.27734375],"STACK":[3.3701171875],"2) Full Time Based Ranges Course":[0.88916015625,1.77734375,2.31591796875,3.00146484375,3.6123046875,3.4453125],"Including the ranges I can't put online.":[4.44384765625,1.5,3.279296875,0.27783203125,2.2939453125,1.5546875,3.22216796875],"The second you're in, you get all of it.":[1.77783203125,3.5009765625,2.9609375,1.16650390625,1.77783203125,1.5,1.11181640625,0.94384765625,0.888671875],"Every time based range I trade, not just the 2 I gave you today.":[2.724609375,2.05615234375,2.89013671875,2.72314453125,0.27783203125,2.72314453125,1.5546875,1.77783203125,1.5,0.55615234375,0.27783203125,2.279296875,1.77783203125,2.87060546875],"That's the NDA I mentioned, you sign it, and then you're sat at the same windows I'm sat at every morning.":[2.90478515625,1.5,2.16650390625,0.27783203125,5.33349609375,1.77783203125,2.0556640625,0.888671875,1.77783203125,2.11083984375,2.9609375,1.4453125,0.88916015625,1.5,2.5576171875,4.22216796875,1.40478515625,1.4453125,0.88916015625,2.61376953125,4.27734375],"You also get the full A-Z model course.":[1.814453125,2.0009765625,1.5,1.5,1.49951171875,1.666015625,2.94482421875,3.55712890625],"Foundations and framework, reading context and bias, liquidity and market structure, and putting it all together.":[5.9990234375,1.77783203125,5.33544921875,3.61181640625,3.55615234375,1.77783203125,2.27880859375,3.8330078125,1.77783203125,3.27978515625,4.6123046875,1.77783203125,3.38720703125,0.61083984375,1.11181640625,4.22265625],"Plus Revealing Of The Veil, which is the deeper framework side of it, and the workbooks that go with every module.":[2.11181640625,4.72412109375,1.11083984375,1.77783203125,2.00146484375,2.83349609375,0.833984375,1.5,3.279296875,5.0576171875,2.0009765625,0.94384765625,0.888671875,1.77783203125,1.5,5.27880859375,1.8330078125,1.2216796875,1.99951171875,2.61376953125,3.83349609375],"So there's nothing I'm holding back from you.":[1.27783203125,3.2392578125,3.6650390625,1.40478515625,3.60986328125,2.279296875,2.22216796875,2.0556640625],"You get what I use.":[1.814453125,1.5,2.27783203125,0.27783203125,2.0009765625],"3) 3 live trading sessions with me, every single week.":[0.88916015625,0.55615234375,1.66796875,3.388671875,4.2802734375,1.99951171875,1.72314453125,2.61376953125,2.8896484375,2.72412109375],"3 mornings a week, I'm live, on my own account, in front of you.":[0.55615234375,4.5556640625,0.55615234375,2.72412109375,1.40478515625,1.94580078125,1.2216796875,1.4453125,1.99951171875,4.11181640625,0.888671875,2.27685546875,0.94384765625,2.0556640625],"You're watching me mark the range, wait for the break, and take the entry while it's actually happening.":[2.99755859375,4.33349609375,1.4453125,2.390625,1.5,3.0009765625,1.94482421875,1.3330078125,1.5,2.9462890625,1.77783203125,2.00146484375,1.5,2.4453125,2.50048828125,1.40478515625,3.72412109375,5.3330078125],"This is super valuable…":[2.0556640625,0.833984375,2.72314453125,5.001953125],"You can't learn to time something from a video.":[1.814453125,2.2939453125,2.39013671875,0.94384765625,2.05615234375,5.0556640625,2.22216796875,0.55615234375,2.8896484375],"You learn it by watching somebody do it live, over and over.":[1.814453125,2.39013671875,0.61083984375,1.1669921875,4.33349609375,5.0009765625,1.2216796875,0.61083984375,1.94580078125,2.1123046875,1.77783203125,2.3349609375],"3 times a week, for 12 weeks, that's 36 mornings of watching this get traded in real time.":[0.55615234375,2.6123046875,0.55615234375,2.72412109375,1.3330078125,1.1123046875,3.2802734375,2.626953125,1.1123046875,4.5556640625,0.94384765625,4.33349609375,1.77783203125,1.5,3.05615234375,0.888671875,1.779296875,2.333984375],"4) Weekly group coaching calls.":[0.88916015625,3.42822265625,2.83251953125,4.3896484375,2.501953125],"This is where we go through everything that happened that week.":[2