you know what I'm watching before the week starts.":[2.724609375,2.4462890625,0.27783203125,2.11083984375,1.4453125,4.27734375,1.3330078125,1.5,2.4462890625,3.16796875,1.1669921875,1.77783203125,2.5556640625,2.27783203125,1.40478515625,4.33349609375,3.05615234375,1.5,2.4462890625,3.00146484375],"And my market commentaries throughout, so when something unusual happens you're not sat there guessing what it meant.":[1.94384765625,1.4453125,3.27978515625,6.78076171875,5.60888671875,1.1669921875,2.5556640625,5.0556640625,3.83349609375,4.11181640625,2.9609375,1.5546875,1.4453125,2.4453125,4.3896484375,2.27783203125,0.61083984375,3.22314453125],"Now, everything I've just walked you through…":[2.3515625,5.05712890625,1.6279296875,1.77783203125,3.3349609375,1.77783203125,4.7763671875],"The full model with every range I trade.":[1.77783203125,1.49951171875,2.94482421875,1.99951171875,2.61376953125,2.72314453125,0.27783203125,2.72314453125],"The 3 live sessions a week.":[1.77783203125,0.55615234375,1.66796875,4.2802734375,0.55615234375,2.72412109375],"The weekly coaching.":[1.77783203125,3.2802734375,4.66748046875],"The community.":[1.77783203125,5.53759765625],"That is already an enormous amount of support.":[2.11083984375,0.833984375,3.50244140625,1.1669921875,4.833984375,3.61083984375,0.94384765625,3.99951171875],"And most of the students I showed you at the start of today?":[1.94384765625,2.38916015625,0.94384765625,1.5,4.1669921875,0.27783203125,3.72265625,1.77783203125,0.88916015625,1.5,2.16748046875,0.94384765625,3.27783203125],"They had exactly that, and nothing else, and they still got those results.":[2.333984375,1.77783203125,3.3916015625,2.11083984375,1.77783203125,3.6650390625,2.22412109375,1.77783203125,2.05615234375,1.72265625,1.5546875,2.6669921875,3.55712890625],"But since you're here with me LIVE right now…":[1.666015625,2.55712890625,2.9609375,2.1123046875,1.99951171875,1.4453125,2.22265625,2.2216796875,2.99951171875],"I decided to add 4 bonuses on top of it.":[0.27783203125,3.77880859375,0.94384765625,1.77783203125,0.55615234375,4.11181640625,1.2216796875,1.5546875,0.94384765625,0.888671875],"And I'm doing it this way on purpose, because every one of these solves a specific problem I already know you're going to run into.":[1.94384765625,1.40478515625,2.72119140625,0.61083984375,1.77783203125,1.89013671875,1.2216796875,4.22265625,4.00244140625,2.61376953125,1.77783203125,0.94384765625,2.6123046875,3.11328125,0.55615234375,3.72412109375,3.94482421875,0.27783203125,3.50244140625,2.5556640625,2.9609375,2.72119140625,0.94384765625,1.61083984375,2.1103515625],"BONUS 1: The Scaling Phase - 3 extra months with me FOR FREE.":[3.611328125,0.88916015625,1.77783203125,3.556640625,2.9462890625,0.3330078125,0.55615234375,2.390625,3.61083984375,1.99951171875,1.4453125,2.11083984375,2.94482421875],"Now, don’t get me wrong… 12 weeks is enough to make you good at this.":[2.3515625,2.443359375,1.5,1.4453125,3.99951171875,1.1123046875,3.00244140625,0.833984375,3.6103515625,0.94384765625,2.5576171875,1.77783203125,2.443359375,0.88916015625,2.0556640625],"I've seen it happen over and over.":[1.6279296875,2.279296875,0.61083984375,3.5556640625,2.1123046875,1.77783203125,2.3349609375],"But week 12 is also exactly where some traders start doing well and immediately get in their own way.":[1.666015625,2.4462890625,1.1123046875,0.833984375,2.0009765625,3.3916015625,2.89013671875,2.6123046875,3.390625,2.16748046875,2.72119140625,1.8896484375,1.77783203125,5.7802734375,1.5,0.888671875,2.1669921875,1.99951171875,2.09375],"You've got a couple of green weeks, you start sizing up, and that's the point where you either go full time or keep struggling with inconsistency.":[3.16455078125,1.5546875,0.55615234375,3.22265625,0.94384765625,2.72314453125,3.2802734375,1.77783203125,2.16748046875,2.83349609375,1.49951171875,1.77783203125,2.626953125,1.5,2.443359375,2.89013671875,1.77783203125,2.72314453125,1.2216796875,1.49951171875,2.05615234375,1,2.279296875,4.88818359375,1.99951171875,6.87255859375],"So if you're in today, you don't stop at week 12.":[1.27783203125,0.61083984375,2.9609375,0.888671875,2.87060546875,1.77783203125,2.4033203125,2.11083984375,0.88916015625,2.4462890625,1.39013671875],"You get another 3 months with me on the other side of it, while you're actually scaling.":[1.814453125,1.5,3.6669921875,0.55615234375,3.61083984375,1.99951171875,1.4453125,1.2216796875,1.5,2.5,2.0009765625,0.94384765625,0.888671875,2.50048828125,2.9609375,3.72412109375,3.7236328125],"Weekly group coaching, the live sessions, the community, all of it continues.":[3.42822265625,2.83251953125,4.66748046875,1.5,1.66796875,4.55810546875,1.5,5.53759765625,1.11181640625,0.94384765625,0.61083984375,5.00048828125],"BONUS 2: I'll pay for your first prop firm challenge myself.":[3.611328125,0.88916015625,1.0712890625,1.72314453125,1.3330078125,2.1669921875,1.88916015625,2.2216796875,1.88916015625,4.61279296875,3.4462890625],"Almost everybody comes to me wanting a funded account…":[3.38916015625,5.00244140625,3.16845703125,0.94384765625,1.4453125,3.77734375,0.55615234375,3.33251953125,4.833984375],"And almost everybody has the same story.":[1.94384765625,3.22314453125,5.00244140625,1.72314453125,1.5,2.5576171875,2.64892578125],"They paid for a challenge before they were ready, they failed it on day 4, and they paid again.":[2.333984375,2.0556640625,1.3330078125,0.55615234375,4.61279296875,3.05615234375,2.05615234375,2.279296875,2.8720703125,2.05615234375,2.61181640625,0.61083984375,1.2216796875,1.72314453125,0.833984375,1.77783203125,2.05615234375,2.0556640625,2.8896484375],"And again.":[1.94384765625,2.8896484375],"A few hundred dollars a go, and every failed one makes you a bit more scared of the next.":[0.72216796875,1.6669921875,3.99951171875,3.27880859375,0.55615234375,1.49951171875,1.77783203125,2.61376953125,2.61181640625,1.77783203125,3.11376953125,1.77783203125,0.55615234375,1.2216796875,2.4453125,3.224609375,0.94384765625,1.5,2.333984375],"So we do it differently.":[1.27783203125,1.333984375,1.2216796875,0.61083984375,5.03759765625],"You don't touch a challenge until I say you're ready for one.":[1.814453125,2.4033203125,2.7216796875,0.55615234375,4.61279296875,2.1103515625,0.27783203125,1.66845703125,2.9609375,2.66845703125,1.3330078125,2.0556640625],"And when I do say it, I pay for it.":[1.94384765625,2.5556640625,0.27783203125,1.2216796875,1.66845703125,0.888671875,0.27783203125,1.72314453125,1.3330078125,0.888671875],"Out of my own pocket.":[1.7216796875,0.94384765625,1.4453125,1.99951171875,3.5009765625],"Because if I'm telling you you're ready, I should be the one taking the risk on that, not you.":[4.11376953125,0.61083984375,1.40478515625,2.9443359375,1.77783203125,2.9609375,2.8720703125,0.27783203125,3.27734375,1.1669921875,1.5,1.77783203125,2.94482421875,1.5,1.779296875,1.2216796875,2.11083984375,1.5546875,2.0556640625],"BONUS 3: Unlimited 1on1 DM access to me.":[3.611328125,0.88916015625,4.5556640625,2.333984375,1.55517578125,3.3369140625,0.94384765625,1.72314453125],"For the whole program.":[1.61083984375,1.5,2.83349609375,4.333984375],"You know the feeling of taking a trade and then sitting there afterwards not sure whether you actually did it right?":[1.814453125,2.5556640625,1.5,3.22265625,0.94384765625,2.94482421875,0.55615234375,2.4453125,1.77783203125,2.11083984375,2.99951171875,2.4453125,5.0576171875,1.5546875,2.1123046875,3.833984375,1.77783203125,3.72412109375,1.49951171875,0.61083984375,2.83251953125],"Green or red, it doesn't matter, you genuinely can't tell if you followed the model or got away with it.":[2.89013671875,1,1.833984375,0.61083984375,3.515625,3.279296875,1.77783203125,4.66748046875,2.2939453125,1.44482421875,0.61083984375,1.77783203125,4.05517578125,1.5,2.94482421875,1,1.5546875,2.4462890625,1.99951171875,0.888671875],"That's the thing that keeps people stuck for years, because you can't fix something you can't see.":[2.90478515625,1.5,2.443359375,1.8330078125,2.83544921875,3.22265625,2.6123046875,1.3330078125,2.8916015625,4.00244140625,1.77783203125,2.2939453125,1.1669921875,5.0556640625,1.77783203125,2.2939453125,1.9462890625],"So you send it to me.":[1.27783203125,1.77783203125,2.333984375,0.61083984375,0.94384765625,1.72314453125],"The chart, what you did, why you did it.":[1.77783203125,2.72314453125,2.27783203125,1.77783203125,1.77734375,1.94482421875,1.77783203125,1.49951171875,0.888671875],"And I'll tell you what actually happened, which is usually not what you thought happened.":[1.94384765625,1.0712890625,1.44482421875,1.77783203125,2.27783203125,3.72412109375,5.00048828125,2.83349609375,0.833984375,3.44580078125,1.5546875,2.27783203125,1.77783203125,3.72021484375,5.00048828125],"And I mean me.":[1.94384765625,0.27783203125,2.6123046875,1.72314453125],"Not a chatbot, not a coach I hired.":[1.666015625,0.55615234375,3.888671875,1.5546875,0.55615234375,2.89013671875,0.27783203125,2.72265625],"Me.":[1.6669921875],"And now the one I've saved for last.":[1.94384765625,1.99951171875,1.5,1.77783203125,1.6279296875,2.83544921875,1.3330078125,2.0009765625],"Because this is the one that makes the biggest difference by a mile.":[4.11376953125,1.77783203125,0.833984375,1.5,1.77783203125,1.8330078125,3.11376953125,1.5,3.5556640625,4.779296875,1.1669921875,0.55615234375,2.27880859375],"BONUS 4: Bi weekly 1on1 calls with me":[3.611328125,0.88916015625,1,3.2802734375,2.333984375,2.22412109375,1.99951171875,1.4453125],"Everyone in this industry loves the words \"1 on 1\".":[4.50244140625,0.888671875,1.77783203125,3.94482421875,2.55712890625,1.5,2.94482421875,1.0302734375,1.2216796875,1.30810546875],"And then it turns out to be a call with 200 people on it where you might get to ask one question if you're quick enough.":[1.94384765625,2.11083984375,0.61083984375,2.5,1.5546875,0.94384765625,1.1669921875,0.55615234375,1.66796875,1.99951171875,1.66845703125,3.22265625,1.2216796875,0.61083984375,2.89013671875,1.77783203125,2.7216796875,1.5,0.94384765625,1.66845703125,1.77783203125,4.16650390625,0.61083984375,2.9609375,2.61181640625,3.88818359375],"That's not what this is.":[2.90478515625,1.5546875,2.27783203125,1.77783203125,1.11181640625],"For the first 3 months, every 2 weeks you and I get on a call.":[1.61083984375,1.5,1.88916015625,0.55615234375,3.888671875,2.61376953125,0.55615234375,3.00244140625,1.77783203125,1.77783203125,0.27783203125,1.5,1.2216796875,0.55615234375,1.94580078125],"We go through your last 2 weeks properly.":[1.48193359375,1.2216796875,3.7763671875,2.1669921875,1.72314453125,0.55615234375,3.00244140625,4.20458984375],"What you took, what you skipped, where your sizing is, what's actually stopping you from moving forward.":[2.44384765625,1.77783203125,2.388671875,2.27783203125,1.77783203125,4.056640625,2.89013671875,2.1669921875,2.83349609375,1.11181640625,3.07177734375,3.72412109375,4.22119140625,1.77783203125,2.22216796875,3.5556640625,3.94482421875],"And then you leave that call knowing exactly what you're working on for the next 2 weeks.":[1.94384765625,2.11083984375,1.77783203125,2.50244140625,1.8330078125,1.66796875,4.05517578125,3.3916015625,2.27783203125,2.9609375,3.83349609375,1.2216796875,1.3330078125,1.5,2.05615234375,0.55615234375,3.2802734375],"On top of the live sessions.":[1.388671875,1.5546875,0.94384765625,1.5,1.66796875,4.55810546875],"On top of the weekly coaching.":[1.388671875,1.5546875,0.94384765625,1.5,3.2802734375,4.66748046875],"On top of being able to message me whenever you want.":[1.388671875,1.5546875,0.94384765625,2.66650390625,2.0009765625,0.94384765625,4.28076171875,1.4453125,4.61328125,1.77783203125,2.5556640625],"I built it this way because I wanted it to be genuinely unreasonable for you not to make it.":[0.27783203125,2.1103515625,0.61083984375,1.77783203125,1.89013671875,4.00244140625,0.27783203125,3.44482421875,0.61083984375,0.94384765625,1.1669921875,4.66748046875,6.501953125,1.3330078125,1.77783203125,1.5546875,0.94384765625,2.5576171875,0.888671875],"Now, here's the part I said we'd come back to… the guarantee.":[2.3515625,2.90625,1.5,1.88916015625,0.27783203125,2.0009765625,2.1826171875,2.6123046875,2.279296875,1.94384765625,1.5,5.05712890625],"If you go through the 6 months with me and you're still not consistently profitable, and you still haven't passed a prop firm challenge…":[0.61083984375,1.77783203125,1.2216796875,3.7763671875,1.5,0.55615234375,3.61083984375,1.99951171875,1.4453125,1.77783203125,2.9609375,1.72265625,1.5546875,5.8349609375,4.83349609375,1.77783203125,1.77783203125,1.72265625,3.4609375,3.4462890625,0.55615234375,2.2216796875,1.88916015625,5.61279296875],"I keep working with you.":[0.27783203125,2.279296875,3.83349609375,1.99951171875,2.0556640625],"Personally.":[5.26171875],"For free.":[1.61083984375,2.1123046875],"Until you're funded.":[2.2216796875,2.9609375,3.6103515625],"And I want to tell you why I can offer that, because a guarantee this strong usually makes people suspicious, and it should.":[1.94384765625,0.27783203125,2.27783203125,0.94384765625,1.44482421875,1.77783203125,1.94482421875,0.27783203125,1.72314453125,2.22216796875,2.11083984375,4.00244140625,0.55615234375,4.779296875,1.77783203125,3.11083984375,3.44580078125,3.11376953125,3.22265625,5.50146484375,1.77783203125,0.61083984375,3.55517578125],"It's because I'm not letting 200 people in.":[1.40478515625,4.00244140625,1.40478515625,1.5546875,2.99951171875,1.66845703125,3.22265625,1.16650390625],"I'm on the live sessions.":[1.40478515625,1.2216796875,1.5,1.66796875,4.55810546875],"I'm on your 1on1 calls.":[1.40478515625,1.2216796875,2.1669921875,2.333984375,2.501953125],"I'm the one answering your DMs.":[1.40478515625,1.5,1.77783203125,4.94580078125,2.1669921875,2.38916015625],"There is a hard limit on how many people I can do that for…":[2.72314453125,0.833984375,0.55615234375,2.1669921875,2.0556640625,1.2216796875,1.99951171875,2.6123046875,3.22265625,0.27783203125,1.72314453125,1.2216796875,